Package: GGT
Title: Geo-Genetic Triangulation
Version: 2.0.0
Description: Locates probable ancestor locations from triangulated IBD
    segments and geocoded family trees (Begg et al. 2023, Current Biology).
    This file lists dependencies; GGT is run as a script (GGT.R), not
    installed as a package.
License: file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: optparse, data.table, sf, ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), maps
Suggests: terra, testthat, sp
